WEBVTT

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:06.883
You are...

00:00:07.091 --> 00:00:08.718
...not needed.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:31.991
<i>Now set free</i>

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.372
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:00:38.581 --> 00:00:42.251
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:48.299
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:50.843
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:00:51.052 --> 00:00:53.471
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:56.015
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:00:56.224 --> 00:01:00.895
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:03.439
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:06.108
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:08.736
<i>Your existence</i>

00:01:08.945 --> 00:01:13.824
<i>Cry out</i>

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:16.244
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:16.619 --> 00:01:18.996
<i>Shout out</i>

00:01:19.205 --> 00:01:21.582
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:29.715
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:01:29.924 --> 00:01:36.305
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:47.441
Impressive, my Priestess.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.944
You have done well to
guide the Palace of the Stars

00:01:50.152 --> 00:01:51.779
to these coordinates.

00:01:51.988 --> 00:01:54.198
Is something here?

00:01:54.407 --> 00:01:56.409
How many dozens of
times have you questioned me?

00:01:56.617 --> 00:02:00.454
If you wish to collect information,
you're being too obvious.

00:02:00.663 --> 00:02:03.874
It is nothing complicated.

00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:06.711
Now, we simply make the gate.

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:08.296
Impossible.

00:02:08.504 --> 00:02:11.841
When one is banished
by the Eternal Abyss,

00:02:12.049 --> 00:02:13.926
there is no return.

00:02:14.135 --> 00:02:16.053
As a Crimson Denizen,

00:02:16.262 --> 00:02:19.682
not even the Creator God
can escape this fate.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.392
No. It is possible.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:26.605
It is entirely possible,
Flame of the Heavens.

00:02:26.814 --> 00:02:31.694
My servants and I have
gathered here with a plan.

00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:35.573
Yes. Ever since that
moment, millennia ago...

00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:38.200
Just before the
Eternal Abyss caught me,

00:02:38.409 --> 00:02:43.873
I took a portion of my Strategist's life,
the Insignia, from her.

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:49.712
"The Divine Gate"

00:02:52.131 --> 00:02:54.383
What do you mean that I'm not needed?

00:02:54.592 --> 00:02:57.345
The General, Thousand
Changes Sydonay,

00:02:57.553 --> 00:03:01.515
said your role in all
this was mere entertainment.

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:05.686
The Strategist and Judge
of Paradoxes, Bel-Peol,

00:03:05.895 --> 00:03:09.190
is aware of our master's
naTveté and inexplicable ways,

00:03:09.398 --> 00:03:12.902
and she has set for herself
the task of overcoming them.

00:03:17.865 --> 00:03:20.034
Why doesn't she set up
a Seal and then devour me?

00:03:20.242 --> 00:03:24.747
However, my opinion differs from theirs.

00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:27.500
You are unnecessary for the
completion of the master's Grand Order.

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:28.834
No...

00:03:29.043 --> 00:03:32.463
You are nothing but a threat to it.

00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:35.674
I see... She's here of her own accord.

00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:50.106
I had my Priestess withdraw
this insignia from the rift.

00:03:50.314 --> 00:03:55.361
And through trial and error,
I gave her the Unrestricted Method

00:03:55.569 --> 00:03:58.739
to craft a vessel able to enforce
my will and wield my power.

00:03:58.948 --> 00:04:01.867
The name given to this
spell was the Grand Order Psalm.

00:04:02.076 --> 00:04:04.578
The Grand Order Psalm...

00:04:04.787 --> 00:04:07.665
I constructed a path within the rift,

00:04:07.873 --> 00:04:10.501
and awaited completion of the vessel.

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:13.421
In this world, it would
harness the Creator God's power,

00:04:13.629 --> 00:04:17.466
and create a gate,
leading back to that path.

00:04:18.551 --> 00:04:20.136
Thousands of years passed,

00:04:20.344 --> 00:04:23.305
and the body was completed,

00:04:23.514 --> 00:04:25.891
despite some deviation
from the original plan.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.978
So you will travel through
this gate, follow the path,

00:04:29.186 --> 00:04:31.230
and regain your original body?

00:04:31.439 --> 00:04:33.190
Just so.

00:04:33.399 --> 00:04:34.400
By my command,

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:37.903
let the Divine Gate come into being.

00:04:40.156 --> 00:04:41.449
This is the place closest to my body,

00:04:41.657 --> 00:04:45.453
where the distortion created by
the Eternal Abyss settled,

00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:50.916
as the endless eons continued to pass.

00:05:03.137 --> 00:05:04.972
It is done.

00:05:09.018 --> 00:05:10.686
Let us begin

00:05:10.895 --> 00:05:14.023
the journey to recover my body.

00:05:21.655 --> 00:05:24.950
I shall excise the threat.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.138
You...

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.519
It's all right.

00:05:51.727 --> 00:05:54.522
L-It is not...

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:56.232
It is not all right!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.108
That Flame Haze is the

00:05:58.317 --> 00:06:00.736
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer!

00:06:01.487 --> 00:06:03.656
She is the avatar of the
god who slays even gods,

00:06:03.864 --> 00:06:05.533
bringer of the dark god,

00:06:05.741 --> 00:06:07.952
the God of Atonement!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:10.829
We must get rid of her...
We should kill her!

00:06:11.038 --> 00:06:15.417
I believe she's taken a dislike to you,
Flame of the Heavens.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:19.964
My Priestess, I commend your loyalty.

00:06:20.172 --> 00:06:24.593
But you are the one who
underestimates the dark god.

00:06:24.802 --> 00:06:30.140
I chose to capture the
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer

00:06:30.349 --> 00:06:34.770
due to the love that Yuji Sakai,
the Mystes, bears for her.

00:06:34.979 --> 00:06:38.023
But that was not the sole reason.

00:06:38.232 --> 00:06:42.194
If I were to kill her here,

00:06:42.403 --> 00:06:44.405
what do you think would happen?

00:06:45.197 --> 00:06:47.199
Would the dark god,
the Flame of the Heavens,

00:06:47.408 --> 00:06:49.910
use his last option and materialize,

00:06:50.119 --> 00:06:54.790
attempting to destroy me instantaneously?

00:06:55.749 --> 00:06:56.917
No...

00:06:57.126 --> 00:07:00.504
This Lord remains intensely
loyal to his perceived fate.

00:07:00.713 --> 00:07:05.175
Thus, he would never choose
something so rash and self-destructive.

00:07:05.384 --> 00:07:07.970
Without question, he would
go back to the Crimson World.

00:07:08.178 --> 00:07:11.432
And upon returning, he would
form a third contract immediately.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.601
Then, alongside his new contractor,

00:07:13.809 --> 00:07:16.186
he would appear before us
at the worst possible moment,

00:07:16.395 --> 00:07:18.939
and perform the Tenpajyosai.

00:07:19.148 --> 00:07:22.318
We're fortunate to have the
Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer.

00:07:22.526 --> 00:07:24.236
We shouldn't waste the chance.

00:07:24.445 --> 00:07:27.448
We mustn't squander our luck in
having the contractor closest to me

00:07:27.656 --> 00:07:30.034
be the one with the dark god

00:07:30.242 --> 00:07:33.329
who could ruin all our plans.

00:07:42.254 --> 00:07:44.048
My! my...

00:07:44.256 --> 00:07:47.635
What a terrible job you've done, Hecate.

00:07:50.512 --> 00:07:54.975
I am overjoyed at this great destiny.

00:07:55.184 --> 00:07:56.560
What a convergence.

00:07:56.769 --> 00:08:00.147
What a journey... What a trial.

00:08:00.356 --> 00:08:02.191
It's as if one had asked,

00:08:02.399 --> 00:08:05.402
and everything requested
had been granted.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:11.533
I see... So, Margery-san
is overseas on work.

00:08:11.742 --> 00:08:15.287
I thought we could have a study group,
like we did during the summer.

00:08:15.496 --> 00:08:19.083
Tanaka and Sato haven't
been at school in a while, either.

00:08:19.291 --> 00:08:21.085
It's kind of lonely.

00:08:22.002 --> 00:08:22.836
Yeah.

00:08:23.045 --> 00:08:24.672
Well, I guess it's okay!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:29.134
Once everyone comes back,
we can have a party.

00:08:29.343 --> 00:08:32.012
Yeah. Let's do that!

00:08:35.432 --> 00:08:38.644
Once everyone comes back...

00:08:38.852 --> 00:08:43.065
Shana-chan protected this place.

00:08:43.273 --> 00:08:48.070
Sakai-kun is also trying
to do something to protect it.

00:08:48.278 --> 00:08:50.072
<i>'An.</i>

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.324
I've been left behind here.

00:08:52.533 --> 00:08:54.952
Isn't there something I can do?

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.296
I see.

00:09:06.505 --> 00:09:09.466
I grasp the basic concept.

00:09:09.675 --> 00:09:10.634
Dantalion...

00:09:10.843 --> 00:09:11.427
Hmm?

00:09:11.635 --> 00:09:13.595
If I confine myself to the footage here,

00:09:13.804 --> 00:09:14.930
may I make some changes?

00:09:15.139 --> 00:09:19.476
I have a backup in the Conloquium.

00:09:19.685 --> 00:09:23.605
Do whatever you like!

00:09:24.565 --> 00:09:27.401
I shall, then.

00:09:31.447 --> 00:09:33.907
Does something bother you?

00:09:34.116 --> 00:09:39.580
I felt that the harmony among
systems was, in part, unnatural.

00:09:39.788 --> 00:09:41.957
There are signs to suggest that

00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:46.253
this Unrestricted System, Absorption,
was functional prior to unification.

00:09:46.462 --> 00:09:47.421
Hmm?

00:09:47.629 --> 00:09:50.507
Only the second Tyrant,
created several hundred years ago,

00:09:50.716 --> 00:09:56.847
should have required the
Unrestricted System, Absorption,

00:09:57.055 --> 00:09:58.974
to gather fragments for its personality.

00:09:59.183 --> 00:10:01.268
That is correct, Sir!

00:10:01.477 --> 00:10:04.646
However, the two
Tyrants function as a single unit.

00:10:04.855 --> 00:10:07.649
So the same systems are
embedded within the first Tyrant,

00:10:07.858 --> 00:10:11.653
which Sir Sabrac placed
in the Midnight Lost Child.

00:10:11.862 --> 00:10:20.204
But that function should
have been deactivated!

00:10:21.079 --> 00:10:24.291
But you say it was active
before the unification?

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.753
Most likely, it was a malfunction
due to an incompatibility

00:10:27.961 --> 00:10:32.508
with the Keeper someone
placed on the Midnight Lost Child.

00:10:32.716 --> 00:10:35.844
I will continue to investigate this,
as I look into your other concern,

00:10:36.053 --> 00:10:40.182
the uncertainties concerning the Treasure.

00:10:44.812 --> 00:10:48.148
How long has it been since
you last drank here, General?

00:10:48.357 --> 00:10:49.483
I couldn't say.

00:10:49.691 --> 00:10:51.777
The drinks are bad as ever.

00:10:54.488 --> 00:10:57.324
I've been here enough to remember that.

00:11:02.704 --> 00:11:04.540
They're excited.

00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:09.086
And uneasy.

00:11:09.294 --> 00:11:10.671
Uneasy with the coming battle,

00:11:10.879 --> 00:11:14.174
and over the change
soon to be visited on the world?

00:11:15.676 --> 00:11:16.927
I apologize.

00:11:17.135 --> 00:11:21.390
I am your general,
but I must be the first to leave.

00:11:21.598 --> 00:11:23.058
Do not concern yourself.

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:26.728
Then we shall remain and do as we must.

00:11:26.937 --> 00:11:31.567
The Servants will go to that
land and achieve the goal. That is all.

00:11:31.775 --> 00:11:35.445
As valiant as you are, we regret that we

00:11:35.654 --> 00:11:39.408
may send only one.

00:11:39.616 --> 00:11:41.451
We who shall fight here

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:47.583
are a shield, guarding the Trinity's back,
as they execute the Grand Order.

00:11:47.791 --> 00:11:51.837
We are honored,
not angered, to fulfill such a role.

00:11:56.717 --> 00:12:00.804
Do you need something,
General Thousand Changes Sydonay?

00:12:01.013 --> 00:12:04.224
No one can predict
what may happen in a war.

00:12:04.433 --> 00:12:06.810
I've said this before, but be careful.

00:12:07.019 --> 00:12:10.188
I am well-versed in our strategies.

00:12:10.397 --> 00:12:13.025
So long as I lead, you needn't worry.

00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:15.027
Don't waste any of my soldiers' lives.

00:12:15.235 --> 00:12:17.738
Offensive formations on attack.

00:12:17.946 --> 00:12:20.324
Defensive in anticipation of counterattack.

00:12:20.532 --> 00:12:23.952
The sole concern is to keep them
from reaching the Palace of the Stars.

00:12:24.161 --> 00:12:25.954
That's correct.

00:12:26.163 --> 00:12:29.291
Your job is to hold out until our return.

00:12:37.299 --> 00:12:43.805
Yeah. I heard about what
happened here after we left.

00:12:44.973 --> 00:12:46.475
We're going now.

00:12:46.683 --> 00:12:51.021
I thought you might have
something you wanted to say to them.

00:12:52.189 --> 00:12:53.941
No, nothing.

00:12:54.149 --> 00:12:55.609
I'm sorry.

00:12:55.817 --> 00:12:57.069
I see.

00:12:57.277 --> 00:13:00.739
Perhaps I was wrong to ask.

00:13:00.948 --> 00:13:01.698
Oh, yeah...

00:13:01.907 --> 00:13:06.662
You know we're headed out to fight him,
but you don't seek to stop us, do you?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:12.501
I'd thought you might ask us to save him.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.671
I can't ask that.

00:13:15.879 --> 00:13:19.299
Everyone believes what
they're doing will protect the world,

00:13:19.508 --> 00:13:23.261
and they'll risk their lives in the fight.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:27.891
So I don't have the right to stop you.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.477
But back there...

00:13:31.728 --> 00:13:35.399
Where he told me goodbye...

00:13:35.607 --> 00:13:37.275
Sakai-kun was there.

00:13:37.484 --> 00:13:40.278
That was definitely Sakai-kun.

00:13:40.487 --> 00:13:45.951
And if he was himself, and he's
trying to do what he thinks he should,

00:13:46.159 --> 00:13:51.373
then I can't be so arrogant
as to request that you save him.

00:13:51.581 --> 00:13:53.458
Oh, I see.

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:58.338
Then I guess I was simply being nosy.

00:13:58.547 --> 00:14:01.591
Did we underestimate her?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:06.013
It seems so.
Humans can change overnight.

00:14:06.221 --> 00:14:09.307
Khamsin-san? Behemoth-san?

00:14:09.516 --> 00:14:12.436
May I ask you something?

00:14:12.644 --> 00:14:15.147
Yeah. What is it?

00:14:15.355 --> 00:14:17.733
It's about this Treasure.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:25.323
I'm coming in, Shana.

00:14:31.413 --> 00:14:33.290
Are you well?

00:14:33.498 --> 00:14:36.334
I'm fine.

00:14:36.543 --> 00:14:38.378
You look good.

00:14:42.215 --> 00:14:43.633
Shana.

00:14:44.259 --> 00:14:45.302
Come with me.

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.387
Where?

00:14:47.596 --> 00:14:50.015
Just upstairs for now.

00:14:51.016 --> 00:14:52.434
<i>Okay -</i>

00:14:57.939 --> 00:15:01.735
Shana, I am about to begin a
journey down a long path.

00:15:01.943 --> 00:15:03.111
A long path?

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.072
The Eternal Abyss...

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.823
I'm retrieving my body

00:15:07.032 --> 00:15:08.742
from the rift between the worlds.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.745
If the Creator God's body is recovered,

00:15:11.953 --> 00:15:13.288
<i>what happens to 'luff?</i>

00:15:13.497 --> 00:15:14.623
Don't worry.

00:15:14.831 --> 00:15:18.085
The Mystes Yuji Sakai's usefulness

00:15:18.293 --> 00:15:22.047
is not limited to his
possession of the Treasure,

00:15:22.255 --> 00:15:24.424
the Midnight Lost Child.

00:15:24.633 --> 00:15:28.929
He is too valuable to simply discard.

00:15:29.137 --> 00:15:33.683
Oh, and I'm not interested in
sacrificing myself for the world,

00:15:33.892 --> 00:15:35.811
so don't worry about that.

00:15:36.019 --> 00:15:40.649
Walking with you is my only wish.

00:15:44.319 --> 00:15:47.697
Yes, I'll do as I must do.

00:15:49.449 --> 00:15:52.744
Why do you think, Pheles-san,

00:15:52.953 --> 00:15:56.957
as a Flame Haze, gave me this?

00:15:57.165 --> 00:16:00.168
Shana-chan tried to help Pheles-san,

00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:02.379
to recover Johann-san.

00:16:02.587 --> 00:16:05.423
She gave this to me for that.

00:16:05.632 --> 00:16:07.217
But...

00:16:07.425 --> 00:16:09.219
She said if I ever use it,

00:16:09.427 --> 00:16:13.098
I'll disappear, without getting my wish.

00:16:13.306 --> 00:16:14.266
But beyond that,

00:16:14.474 --> 00:16:17.060
if Sakai-kun didn't choose me,

00:16:17.269 --> 00:16:22.107
I'd become saddened and lose
the feelings required to use it.

00:16:22.315 --> 00:16:26.027
But Pheles-san gave it to me anyway.

00:16:26.236 --> 00:16:27.821
So, basically...

00:16:28.029 --> 00:16:28.864
Yes...

00:16:29.072 --> 00:16:31.783
You don't understand why
the Colorful Wind

00:16:31.992 --> 00:16:35.954
would give someone an item,
which could save the one she loves,

00:16:36.163 --> 00:16:38.039
if she didn't know they could use it.

00:16:38.248 --> 00:16:40.584
Yes, I want to know...

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:44.504
What it meant when
Pheles-san gave this to me.

00:16:44.713 --> 00:16:49.092
Right now, I doubt I could use it.

00:16:49.301 --> 00:16:56.099
Not because I'll disappear or anything...

00:16:56.308 --> 00:17:01.313
But back then,
Sakai-kun's joy and my joy

00:17:01.521 --> 00:17:04.649
became different things.

00:17:04.858 --> 00:17:06.902
I wanted for us to share our joy.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:09.821
That was all, but...

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:13.325
If you can go back, you should.

00:17:13.533 --> 00:17:16.036
I can't go back!

00:17:16.244 --> 00:17:17.621
The fact that I'm here...

00:17:17.829 --> 00:17:19.497
That all this happened...

00:17:19.706 --> 00:17:21.625
It's what I chose.

00:17:21.833 --> 00:17:24.920
It proves my existence!

00:17:25.128 --> 00:17:27.047
Even Sakai-kun can't...

00:17:27.255 --> 00:17:28.632
So for now...

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:33.428
I want anything that will help
me understand Pheles-san!

00:17:34.888 --> 00:17:37.724
Humans are wonderful
creatures, aren't they,

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:39.726
Steadfast Sharp Peak Behemoth?

00:17:39.935 --> 00:17:44.481
And that is why our fight has meaning,

00:17:44.689 --> 00:17:46.524
Khamsin Nbh'w.

00:17:46.733 --> 00:17:49.152
Okay, Kazumi Yoshida-san.

00:17:49.361 --> 00:17:52.072
A terrible old story goes like this...

00:17:53.281 --> 00:17:56.534
Once, in a hot land,

00:17:56.743 --> 00:18:00.080
there was a prince, known as a prodigy.

00:18:00.288 --> 00:18:01.373
One day,

00:18:01.581 --> 00:18:05.669
a monster who consumed the power
of existence attacked the country.

00:18:05.877 --> 00:18:08.922
To protect the king,
the prince fought the monster.

00:18:09.881 --> 00:18:13.426
The prince knew the king hated him.

00:18:13.635 --> 00:18:16.471
But even so, the prince battled the monster.

00:18:18.056 --> 00:18:20.225
Naturally, the prince lost.

00:18:20.433 --> 00:18:23.520
When all that remained
was for the monster to eat him,

00:18:23.728 --> 00:18:26.356
he heard a strange voice.

00:18:27.274 --> 00:18:29.192
"If you abandon all you have as a human,

00:18:29.401 --> 00:18:35.031
and become my vessel,
I will give you great power."

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.659
The prince gained a great power,

00:18:37.867 --> 00:18:39.703
and drove away the monster.

00:18:39.911 --> 00:18:44.624
But though he'd risked his
life for the king and his retainers,

00:18:44.833 --> 00:18:47.544
none of them remembered him.

00:18:48.586 --> 00:18:53.049
That was what it meant to
abandon all he had as a human.

00:18:53.258 --> 00:18:55.135
The prince went out, into the wide world,

00:18:55.343 --> 00:18:57.304
following the monster.

00:18:58.471 --> 00:18:59.848
Hundreds of years later,

00:19:00.056 --> 00:19:02.559
he found the monster again.

00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:04.978
After a long, long time,

00:19:05.186 --> 00:19:08.440
he'd finally found someone
who knew him as he truly was.

00:19:08.648 --> 00:19:13.111
The prince hated the monster
for having driven him to this fate.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.115
But at the same time,
the prince loved the monster,

00:19:17.324 --> 00:19:20.577
and the monster loved the prince, too.

00:19:20.785 --> 00:19:22.203
Why?

00:19:22.495 --> 00:19:25.832
It was the prince who
killed the monster he loved,

00:19:26.041 --> 00:19:27.792
as it lay in his arms.

00:19:28.001 --> 00:19:30.795
And it was the monster who
inflicted a wound that was almost,

00:19:31.004 --> 00:19:34.549
but not quite mortal,
on the prince it loved.

00:19:34.758 --> 00:19:37.260
Both thought that
this was what they should do,

00:19:37.469 --> 00:19:40.138
and both knew they would regret it.

00:19:40.347 --> 00:19:43.475
And both knew they loved one another.

00:19:43.683 --> 00:19:45.894
But both killed the other anyway.

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:49.147
That was love, in a sense.

00:19:50.357 --> 00:19:52.025
For those who love another...

00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:55.820
To disobey, to rage, to curse, to fight, to kill...

00:19:56.029 --> 00:19:58.865
None of these disproves that love.

00:19:59.074 --> 00:20:03.036
A love that's too strong
may even make those more likely.

00:20:06.581 --> 00:20:11.127
Love isn't just what
the other person wants...

00:20:12.754 --> 00:20:16.883
Everyone awaits your words.

00:20:17.092 --> 00:20:18.510
Very well.

00:20:19.844 --> 00:20:22.222
There are so many!

00:20:24.391 --> 00:20:26.309
Do you feel it in your heart?

00:20:26.518 --> 00:20:28.478
Does your body shake?

00:20:28.686 --> 00:20:31.064
That is proof that you are to walk with me.

00:20:31.272 --> 00:20:35.985
I move us now to the
second stage of the Grand Order!

00:20:37.278 --> 00:20:39.406
Above us!

00:20:39.614 --> 00:20:41.699
I shall travel through the gate,

00:20:41.908 --> 00:20:45.120
to recover my other self,

00:20:45.328 --> 00:20:49.416
the body of the Snake of the Festival,
beyond the Eternal Abyss.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.753
I issue this order to you who will remain...

00:20:53.962 --> 00:20:57.924
Protect the Palace
of the Stars until my return!

00:20:58.133 --> 00:20:59.884
Wield sharpened blades,

00:21:00.093 --> 00:21:03.054
bare fangs and claws, and howl!

00:21:03.263 --> 00:21:05.181
Burn your flame brightly!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.350
Use all your wit and wisdom!

00:21:07.559 --> 00:21:08.601
Existence!

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:11.521
Give everything you have

00:21:11.729 --> 00:21:13.440
to prove that you exist in this world!

00:21:13.648 --> 00:21:15.692
Fight! Fight!

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.527
Fight!

00:21:18.695 --> 00:21:21.948
If you do, I shall reach the final stage

00:21:22.157 --> 00:21:24.409
of the Grand Order.

00:21:24.617 --> 00:21:26.870
And change the world.

00:21:27.078 --> 00:21:29.080
This time, we'll succeed!

00:21:30.415 --> 00:21:35.128
Hail the Snake of
the Festival, the Creator God!

00:21:40.425 --> 00:21:42.510
I'll be back, Shana.

00:21:44.262 --> 00:21:49.559
I shall show the entire world

00:21:49.767 --> 00:21:52.770
my desire for change!

00:21:57.859 --> 00:22:00.820
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:01.029 --> 00:22:04.407
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:04.616 --> 00:22:07.577
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:07.785 --> 00:22:13.541
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:14.834
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:15.043 --> 00:22:18.129
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:18.338 --> 00:22:21.466
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:21.674 --> 00:22:24.886
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.094 --> 00:22:28.264
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.473 --> 00:22:31.601
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:31.809 --> 00:22:34.979
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.188 --> 00:22:38.900
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.108 --> 00:22:41.819
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.028 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.576 --> 00:22:50.078
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.286 --> 00:22:51.329
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.538 --> 00:22:53.289
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:22:56.918
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.126 --> 00:23:00.255
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.463 --> 00:23:03.675
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:03.883 --> 00:23:06.719
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:06.928 --> 00:23:10.473
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.682 --> 00:23:13.601
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:22.318
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:25.738 --> 00:23:29.993
Wilhelmina tries to raise the
Palace of Heaven's Road, to recover Shana.

00:23:30.201 --> 00:23:34.789
And Sophie Sawallisch, Commander
of the Flame Hazes, has plans of her own.

00:23:34.998 --> 00:23:37.292
Next time, on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.502
"The War Begins."
